  "cause": {
    "proximate_text": "The cause of the TSV failing to open was a degraded reset spring located in the trip knob assembly of the valve. The degradation of the reset spring occurred because there was no preventive maintenance scheduled for replacing the spring. As a result, the degraded reset spring lacked the necessary spring force to assist in opening the valve.",
    "cause_code": "X",
    "category": "Other",
    "theme": "missing PM task for spring replacement",
